A coroutine with co_return, its promise type from libstdc++'s <coroutine>.
Coroutines are not supported: the call of coro() fails the property that
says so (see cpp20_coroutines); verification used to succeed with the
coroutine run as an ordinary function.  Tagged libstdcxx: the program
falls back to an empty main where <coroutine> is not usable with cl.
